# ===== september_enjoy export rules (2026-09-17) =====
# The new public repo is code-first. Markdown is ignored EXCEPT operational
# core (AGENTS/CLAUDE/CURRENT_PLAN/README/CHANGELOG) and the four guide files
# under frontend/public/guides/ that GuideModal.tsx fetches at runtime.
*.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/CURRENT_PLAN.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!frontend/public/guides/*.md
# NOTE (2026-09-30): the Raster Sources plan/tracker/report were briefly
# un-ignored here so they would get version history, then reverted before the
# push. Reason: `origin` is a **public** repo and this file's policy above is
# deliberately code-first. The plan, tracker and report are the owner's internal
# working memory — 44 revisions of decisions, audit findings and incident records
# — and are not for publication. They stay local; `AGENTS.md` and
# `CURRENT_PLAN.md` carry the Session brief that points at them, which works on
# this machine. Consequence accepted: a fresh *clone* gets dangling links to
# those three files.

# Transient backend log the owner drops in the repo root when something breaks
# (2026-09-30). It is a symptom dump, not source, and it would otherwise be
# committed alongside the fix it describes.
/Backend_error.txt

# Images are ignored entirely, EXCEPT frontend/public/cfms-logo.png (favicon
# in index.html + Login/Layout header branding).
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
*.webp
*.bmp
*.ico
!frontend/public/cfms-logo.png

# Local design mock-ups for plan files (working memory, like the *.md plan files)
/FOREST_SUMMARY_PANEL_MOCKUP.html

# fixed pictures an OP template places with {{asset:name}} (RAMBHADEVI_SFM_RENEW_TEMPLATE_PLAN.md)
!backend/app/assets/op_images/*.png

# API key scratch file (never commit)
/gemini_api_key_free_tier.txt

